      "can kids have protein powder",
      "protein powder for teenage athletes",
      "how much protein do teens need"
    ],
  }}
  jsonLd={schema}
>
  <article class="relative overflow-hidden">
    <ArticleHeader kicker={"Buyer's Guide"} badge={"Updated November 2026"} author={author} dates={dates} mobileAd={false}>
      <Fragment slot="title">Best Protein Powder for Teens</Fragment>
      Most teens get enough protein from food. For the ones who genuinely need a shake, these seven are ranked on what matters for a growing athlete: third-party banned-substance testing, a short ingredient list and a sensible dose.
    </ArticleHeader>

    <TableOfContents>
      <a href="#quick-comparison">Quick Comparison</a>
      <a href="#top-picks">Our Top Picks</a>
      <a href="#do-teens-need-it">Do Teens Need It?</a>
      <a href="#how-much-protein">How Much Protein Teens Need</a>
      <a href="#can-kids-have-it">Can Kids Have Protein Powder?</a>
      <a href="#certifications">Banned-Substance Testing</a>
      <a href="#what-to-avoid">What to Avoid</a>
