            These seven are ranked on label analysis, certification status and how well each fits a teenager's needs, not on our own lab tests or a tasting panel. We weighted banned-substance certification heavily because a contaminated supplement can end a high school or college athlete's season, and we left out anything with stimulants, added creatine or a high-sugar gainer formula. Nutrition figures come from each label at the time of writing and vary by flavor, and every certification should be confirmed for the exact product and flavor in the certifier's own database, because listings change.
          </p>

